\frametitle{References}
To validate that \texttt{references.bib} is syntactically clean and
contains the required fields per entry type, this validator is only
runnable when the project is checked out under the template monorepo's
\breaktt{projects/working/} (it is not on the standalone repo's own
dependency graph), invoked from the monorepo root with a
monorepo-relative path:

\begin{Shaded}
\begin{Highlighting}[]
\ExtensionTok{uv}\NormalTok{ run python }\AttributeTok{{-}m}\NormalTok{ infrastructure.reference.citation.cli validate }\DataTypeTok{\textbackslash{}}
\NormalTok{    projects/working/active\_fedference/manuscript/references.bib }\AttributeTok{{-}{-}strict}
\end{Highlighting}
\end{Shaded}
